{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a world where megacorporation's rule the cities and freedom has become a commodity, you are a dreamer who paid a high price for a chance at a better life. Fifteen thousand dollars. That\u2019s the debt you took on to gain access to a secret mercenary platform, where people become agents and their fates are forged in the shadows.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ve made a choice that will change your life forever. Will it lead you to greatness, or will you drown in the neon abyss of despair? In this world, every contract is a risk, every decision a moral boundary.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Hardcore Sci-Fi Cyberpunk Text RPG</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is not just a game\u2014it\u2019s a test of your decisions, tactics, and resilience. Every choice you make is irreversible. There are no Save-Load options. You live with the consequences of your actions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This single-player RPG immerses you in a gripping experience of growth and survival. Develop unique attributes, master various weapons, and refine your skills as you navigate a world where every decision shapes your fate.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd25 <strong>Dice-based combat system</strong> \u2013 Your fate depends on your skills, strategy, and luck.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3492360/extras/7bcb55e214c1a23598c4f0c15394509a.poster.avif?t=1760254373\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3492360/extras/7bcb55e214c1a23598c4f0c15394509a.webm?t=1760254373\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3492360/extras/7bcb55e214c1a23598c4f0c15394509a.mp4?t=1760254373\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd2b <strong>Diverse combat styles</strong> \u2013 Choose between firearms, melee weapons, or heavy weaponry. Improve stealth, hacking, or combat abilities to unlock unique solutions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf06 <strong>The life of an agent</strong> \u2013 Beyond missions, manage your condition: food, sleep, health. Relax in bars or train in gyms, but always be prepared for the next task.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3492360/extras/cf4a3ed1f00525a9c47f20497fb364a9.poster.avif?t=1760254373\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3492360/extras/cf4a3ed1f00525a9c47f20497fb364a9.webm?t=1760254373\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3492360/extras/cf4a3ed1f00525a9c47f20497fb364a9.mp4?t=1760254373\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2696\ufe0f <strong>Moral dilemmas</strong> \u2013 Your choice between Aegis and the Resistance determines not just the story, but your fate. Every decision carries weight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beneath the neon glow and suffocating smog, millions live just like you. In this world, you are not just a mercenary\u2014you are a person fighting for the chance to reclaim your freedom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Are you ready to take the risk and step into the Shadows?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Debt Free","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3492360/a7f2f4fe5d198add009e32e13a24a65a6435073c.jpg"},{"name":"Master of Desire","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3492360/6